# Apptainer definition file for GeoCoT environment.
#
# BUILDTIME: Bootstrap:docker from Azure Linux 3.0.20260401 on MCR (mcr.microsoft.com).
#   Using dated tag 3.0.20260401-amd64 because tag "3.0" returns JWS manifest
#   which Apptainer docker conveyor cannot parse (invalid char after top-level value).
#   The dated tag returns clean v2 JSON manifest.
#   MCR is HTTP 200 accessible with no Docker Hub rate limits.
# RUNTIME: Job script installs Python + CUDA on compute node.

Bootstrap: docker
From: mcr.microsoft.com/azurelinux/base/core:3.0.20260401-amd64
